Defined Objectives:
As stated in Article 1 of the Constitution, FAO’s objectives include: - Collecting, analyzing, interpreting, and disseminating information related to nutrition, food, and agriculture (Article I, Section 1);
Promoting and recommending national and international action on scientific, technological, social, and economic research related to nutrition, food, and agriculture; improving education and administration in these fields; conserving natural resources; improving methods of agricultural production; processing, marketing, and distribution of food and agricultural products; and adopting policies for agricultural credit and commodity arrangements (Article I, Section 2);
Providing technical assistance, organizing missions to assist governments, and taking necessary actions to implement the purposes of the Organization as set forth in the Preamble (Article I, Section 3) (https://www.fao.org/3/k8024e/k8024e.pdf)

The objectives of the Intergovernmental Oceanographic Commission (IOC), as per Articles 2 and 3 of its statutes, include to: advance the scientific understanding of the nature and resources of the oceans (Article 2, Paragraph a); improve the effectiveness of oceanographic methodologies and techniques (Article 2, Paragraph b); promote and facilitate the international study of the ocean for peaceful purposes (Article 3, Paragraph a);  Encourage and assist the establishment and expansion of international cooperation in marine scientific research (Article 3, Paragraph b);  Promote and facilitate the exchange of oceanographic data and information (Article 3, Paragraph c:); 
 Promote and facilitate the dissemination of the results of oceanographic research and the transfer of knowledge resulting from it (Article 3, Paragraph d:); Promote and facilitate the development of the necessary infrastructure for marine scientific research (Article 3, Paragraph e);
Promote and facilitate the training and education of scientists and technical personnel in the field of oceanography (Article 3, Paragraph f). ((https://treaties.un.org/doc/Publication/UNTS/Volume%204/volume-4-I-52-English.pdf))
